DESCRIPTION:The use of AI and AI Agents in everyday Django can be viewed as
  `AI as API` where we can create on the Django side powerful agentic APIs.
  \n\nIf\, for example\, we have a SEARCH\, HELP or FAQ section in our app\
 , we can add AI components to leverage AI.\n\nWe will also look at framewo
 rks that can offer convenience and increased functionality.\n\nFinally\, w
 e cover how we can test and evaluate our LLM responses.
